sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Retailer Staff
    participant API as Reflex API
    participant WS as Socket.io (broadcast)
    participant D as Dispatcher
    participant Ri as Rider

    R->>API: POST /deliveries (customer, address, item)
    API->>API: create row, status = Requested, log history
    API->>WS: emit delivery:created
    WS-->>D: board updates — new open request appears
    WS-->>R: own list updates — status: Requested

    D->>API: PATCH /deliveries/:id/assign (rider_id)
    API->>API: status -> Assigned, log history
    API->>WS: emit delivery:update
    WS-->>Ri: delivery appears on their device
    WS-->>R: status: Assigned, rider name + phone visible

    Ri->>API: PATCH /deliveries/:id/status (Picked Up)
    API->>API: validate rider owns this delivery + transition allowed
    API->>WS: emit delivery:update
    WS-->>R: status: Picked Up
    WS-->>D: board reflects Picked Up

    Ri->>API: POST /deliveries/:id/proof (photo)
    API->>API: require status = Picked Up + photo present
    API->>API: status -> Delivered, store photo path, log history
    API->>WS: emit delivery:update
    WS-->>R: status: Delivered, proof photo visible
    WS-->>D: board reflects Delivered
